# Line endings: LF everywhere, so the patches apply, shell scripts and Python tools run on Linux and in CI, and a
# clone made on Windows builds in WSL. Binary files are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mkv binary
*.bin binary
*.ac3 binary
*.dts binary
*.eac3 binary
*.zip binary
